That is the canonical three-fold recalibration. Textually it is realised as four verbal/nominal mentions of the shin’el/overcoat, with the fourth being the incidental departure presence. On the strict “describe = symbolic re-description of the coat’s condition/state tracking mentality” reading the question asks for, the taught count is three symbolic descriptions, four mentions.

